  "bugs": [
    {
      "id": "BUG-USERAUTH-001",
      "title": "admin 账号口令以明文存储导致文档给定管理员凭据无法登录",
      "module": "user/auth",
      "status": "closed",
      "severity": "S3",
      "severity_basis": "测试库种子数据：仅影响 admin 种子账号登录，注册/正常用户均正确 bcrypt；不影响线上代码逻辑",
      "priority": "P3",
      "category": "data_seed",
      "environment": "本地开发 MySQL ai_chat",
      "preconditions": "使用任务给定 admin/123456",
      "steps": [
        "POST /api/user/login {username:admin,password:123456}",
        "查库 SELECT password FROM user WHERE id=63"
      ],
      "actual_result": "登录 401 '用户名或密码错误'；查库 password 字段值为明文 123456(非 bcrypt 前缀)",
      "expected_result": "种子管理员口令应 bcrypt 哈希存储，admin/123456 可正常登录",
      "reproducibility": "always",
      "repro_attempts": 2,
      "first_failure_preserved": true,
      "evidence_grade": "L2_observation",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EV-005",
        "EV-007"
      ],
      "impact": "文档管理员账号无法登录，运维/管理员入口在本环境不可用",
      "analysis": {
        "classification": "data",
        "trigger_hypothesis": "种子/SQL 初始化脚本直接写入明文口令，未走 BCryptPasswordEncoder.encode",
        "change_correlation": "与兄弟代理在跑功能修复无直接关联",
        "blast_radius": "仅 admin(id=63) 种子行；新建用户(如 id=88)哈希正常",
        "confidence": "high"
      },
      "workaround": "用 demo_alice/Test@123456 或新注册账号登录；或修正种子为 bcrypt 哈希",
      "related_ids": [
        "EXE-SYSTEMTEST01-003",
        "EXE-SYSTEMTEST01-013",
        "EXE-SYSTEMTEST01-014",
        "EXE-SYSTEMTEST01-015"
      ],
      "independent_failure_signature": "admin-seed-password-plaintext-not-bcrypt",
      "resolution": "已修复并复验关闭：根因=admin(id=63)口令明文 + AdminServiceImpl 原手写明文 equals 兼容分支。修复3处：①AdminServiceImpl 统一 passwordEncoder.matches（兼容{bcrypt}前缀与裸$2a$，明文必然不匹配）；②AdminServiceImplTest 移除明文兼容契约用例，新增「{bcrypt}前缀哈希正确匹配」「明文口令不兼容返回null」两用例，Admin相关21用例全过；③库中 UPDATE user SET password=bcrypt哈希 WHERE id=63。MainAgent 验证：/api/user/login admin/123456→200、/api/admin/login→200、错误密码→401、demo_alice({bcrypt})→200、gyb789(裸$2a$)→200。我方独立复验(verify_fix.txt,L2)：user-login 200、admin-login 200、错误密码 401、demo_alice 200。"
    }
  ],
